{"id":"fcddcc8eb9f89d5d","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-eq-fibration-morphism.md","title":"Eq 纤维化态射","display":"df-equality-fibration-morphism — Eq 纤维化态射","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-eq-fibration-morphism","aliases":["16-df-eq-fibration-morphism","Equality-fibration morphism"],"display":"df-equality-fibration-morphism — Eq 纤维化态射","depends_on":["[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]","[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-19","source":"Definition3.6.1 pp.209–210 (PDF229–230); Eq-fibration background Definition3.5.1 p.201 (PDF221); explicit canonical mate with product transport"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-eq-fibration-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-eq-fibration-morphism</span><span>Equality-fibration morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equality-fibration-morphism — Eq 纤维化态射"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"427be4d627513590\" href=\"?note=427be4d627513590\" title=\"16-df-cartesian-morphism\">16-df-cartesian-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b663a0efd45aead\" href=\"?note=8b663a0efd45aead\" title=\"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor\">16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition3.6.1 pp.209–210 (PDF229–230); Eq-fibration background Definition3.5.1 p.201 (PDF221); explicit canonical mate with product transport"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal A\">\\(q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal A\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"478c99d853e13c93\" href=\"?note=478c99d853e13c93\" title=\"16-df-eq-fibration\">16-df-eq-fibration</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal A\">\\(K:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span> 为函子。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_I\">\\(H_I\\)</span> 为纤维限制，只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"qH=Kp\">\\(qH=Kp\\)</span> 时使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta=\\delta^p_{I,J}:U\\to V\">\\(\\delta=\\delta^p_{I,J}:U\\to V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=I\\times J,V=(I\\times J)\\times J\">\\(U=I\\times J,V=(I\\times J)\\times J\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 保有限积时，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=c_{K,I,J}:KU\\xrightarrow{\\sim}KI\\times KJ\">\\(a=c_{K,I,J}:KU\\xrightarrow{\\sim}KI\\times KJ\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(a\\times\\operatorname{id}_{KJ})c_{K,U,J}:KV\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(KI\\times KJ)\\times KJ\">\\(b=(a\\times\\operatorname{id}_{KJ})c_{K,U,J}:KV\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(KI\\times KJ)\\times KJ\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b663a0efd45aead\" href=\"?note=8b663a0efd45aead\" title=\"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor\">16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor</a> 的规范比较。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 在下文正式构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon^L\">\\(\\epsilon^L\\)</span> 为该伴随的余单位。</li>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\">\\(p,q\\)</span> 的提升选择及等式伴随族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta^p\">\\(\\eta^p\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}\\dashv\\delta^*\">\\(\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}\\dashv\\delta^*\\)</span> 的单位。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^p_{\\delta,X}:\\delta^*X\\to X\">\\(\\kappa^p_{\\delta,X}:\\delta^*X\\to X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^q_{K\\delta,H_VX}:(K\\delta)^*H_VX\\to H_VX\">\\(\\kappa^q_{K\\delta,H_VX}:(K\\delta)^*H_VX\\to H_VX\\)</span> 是所选笛卡尔提升。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_{\\delta,X}\">\\(\\rho_{\\delta,X}\\)</span> 由下文唯一垂直因子确定，只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 保持笛卡尔箭头时使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{PresFinProd}\\)</span> 采用本页直接依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqFibMor}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqFibMor}\\)</span> 的所有比较只在其前面结构条件成立的分支上构造。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon^L\">\\(\\epsilon^L\\)</span> 在下文以唯一描述确定：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 的纤维是预序，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{I,J}\\dashv(K\\delta)^*\">\\(L_{I,J}\\dashv(K\\delta)^*\\)</span> 的余单位分量为相应 Hom 中唯一的箭头。该定义中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{KV}\">\\(Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{KV}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nL_{I,J}&amp;\\coloneqq b^*\\mathsf{Eq}^{q}_{KI,KJ}(a^{-1})^*,\n&amp;L_{I,J}&amp;\\dashv(K\\delta)^*,\\\\\n\\{\\epsilon^L_Z\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D_{KV}}(L_{I,J}(K\\delta)^*Z,Z),\\\\\n\\{\\rho_{\\delta,X}\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{r:H_U\\delta^*X\\to(K\\delta)^*H_VX\\mid\nqr=\\operatorname{id}_{KU}\\land\\kappa^q_{K\\delta,H_VX}r=H(\\kappa^p_{\\delta,X})\\},\\\\\nc_{I,J,Y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\epsilon^L_{H_V\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y}\\circ\nL_{I,J}(\\rho_{\\delta,\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y}\\circ H_U\\eta^p_Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFibMor}(K,H;p,q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nqH=Kp\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E)\n(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(Hf))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{PresFinProd}(H_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D_{K((I\\times J)\\times J)}}(c_{I,J,Y}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nL_{I,J}&amp;\\coloneqq b^*\\mathsf{Eq}^{q}_{KI,KJ}(a^{-1})^*,\n&amp;L_{I,J}&amp;\\dashv(K\\delta)^*,\\\\\n\\{\\epsilon^L_Z\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D_{KV}}(L_{I,J}(K\\delta)^*Z,Z),\\\\\n\\{\\rho_{\\delta,X}\\}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{r:H_U\\delta^*X\\to(K\\delta)^*H_VX\\mid\nqr=\\operatorname{id}_{KU}\\land\\kappa^q_{K\\delta,H_VX}r=H(\\kappa^p_{\\delta,X})\\},\\\\\nc_{I,J,Y}&amp;\\coloneqq\\epsilon^L_{H_V\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y}\\circ\nL_{I,J}(\\rho_{\\delta,\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y}\\circ H_U\\eta^p_Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFibMor}(K,H;p,q)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\nqH=Kp\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(K)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E)\n(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(Hf))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{PresFinProd}(H_I)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D_{K((I\\times J)\\times J)}}(c_{I,J,Y}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>由积比较有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"bK\\delta=\\delta^q_{KI,KJ}a\">\\(bK\\delta=\\delta^q_{KI,KJ}a\\)</span>，沿同构的重索引为等价，所以所示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 确是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K\\delta)^*\">\\((K\\delta)^*\\)</span> 的左伴随。笛卡尔泛性质给唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 保笛卡尔，则它可逆。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 作用于原单位再用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 运输所得箭头的伴随转置；其源为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{I,J}H_UY\">\\(L_{I,J}H_UY\\)</span>，靶为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_V\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y\">\\(H_V\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y\\)</span>，两者同在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{KV}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{KV}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这避免将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K(I\\times J)\">\\(K(I\\times J)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"KI\\times KJ\">\\(KI\\times KJ\\)</span> 当作字面相等，也不把canonical mate仅以名字声明。原书 Definition3.6.1 pp.209–210 (PDF229–230) 定义Eq-fibration态射；Eq-fibration结构本身见Definition3.5.1 p.201 (PDF221)。该态射在§3.6用于分类模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"427be4d627513590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor","status":"resolved","id":"8b663a0efd45aead","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-eq-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"478c99d853e13c93","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$、$q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal A$ 满足 [[16-df-eq-fibration]]；$K:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal A$、$H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D$ 为函子。$H_I$ 为纤维限制，只在 $qH=Kp$ 时使用。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor","status":"resolved","id":"8b663a0efd45aead","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\delta=\\delta^p_{I,J}:U\\to V$，$U=I\\times J,V=(I\\times J)\\times J$。在 $K$ 保有限积时，$a=c_{K,I,J}:KU\\xrightarrow{\\sim}KI\\times KJ$、$b=(a\\times\\operatorname{id}_{KJ})c_{K,U,J}:KV\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(KI\\times KJ)\\times KJ$ 取 [[16-df-finite-product-preserving-functor]] 的规范比较。$L$ 在下文正式构造，$\\epsilon^L$ 为该伴随的余单位。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"K:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"H:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"H_I","display":false},{"tex":"qH=Kp","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta=\\delta^p_{I,J}:U\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"U=I\\times J,V=(I\\times J)\\times J","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"a=c_{K,I,J}:KU\\xrightarrow{\\sim}KI\\times KJ","display":false},{"tex":"b=(a\\times\\operatorname{id}_{KJ})c_{K,U,J}:KV\\xrightarrow{\\sim}(KI\\times KJ)\\times KJ","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon^L","display":false},{"tex":"p,q","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta^p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}\\dashv\\delta^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^p_{\\delta,X}:\\delta^*X\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa^q_{K\\delta,H_VX}:(K\\delta)^*H_VX\\to H_VX","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_{\\delta,X}","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PresFinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqFibMor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon^L","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"L_{I,J}\\dashv(K\\delta)^*","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal D_{KV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nL_{I,J}&\\coloneqq b^*\\mathsf{Eq}^{q}_{KI,KJ}(a^{-1})^*,\n&L_{I,J}&\\dashv(K\\delta)^*,\\\\\n\\{\\epsilon^L_Z\\}&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D_{KV}}(L_{I,J}(K\\delta)^*Z,Z),\\\\\n\\{\\rho_{\\delta,X}\\}&\\coloneqq\\{r:H_U\\delta^*X\\to(K\\delta)^*H_VX\\mid\nqr=\\operatorname{id}_{KU}\\land\\kappa^q_{K\\delta,H_VX}r=H(\\kappa^p_{\\delta,X})\\},\\\\\nc_{I,J,Y}&\\coloneqq\\epsilon^L_{H_V\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y}\\circ\nL_{I,J}(\\rho_{\\delta,\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y}\\circ H_U\\eta^p_Y),\\\\\n\\mathrm{EqFibMor}(K,H;p,q)&\\Longleftrightarrow\nqH=Kp\\land\\mathrm{PresFinProd}(K)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land(\\forall f\\in\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal E)\n(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Cartesian}_q(Hf))\\\\\n&\\quad\\land(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{PresFinProd}(H_I)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land(\\forall I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_{I\\times J})\\\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{\\mathcal D_{K((I\\times J)\\times J)}}(c_{I,J,Y}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"bK\\delta=\\delta^q_{KI,KJ}a","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"(K\\delta)^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"L_{I,J}H_UY","display":false},{"tex":"H_V\\mathsf{Eq}^p_{I,J}Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{KV}","display":false},{"tex":"K(I\\times J)","display":false},{"tex":"KI\\times KJ","display":false}],"bytes":3641,"backlinks":[{"id":"22039ebbb905273f","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L,K:\\mathcal E_H\\to\\mathcal E$ 为候选函子，$a,b\\in O_H$，$f\\in\\mathcal E_H(a,b)$。$\\mathrm{ExtEq}_{M,p}(L)$、$\\mathrm{VIso}_{M,p}(L,K;\\eta)$ 及 $\\mathrm{FibModel}_{\\Sigma,H}(M,p)$ 在下文定义；$\\mathrm{EqFibMor}$ 采用 [[16-df-eq-fibration-morphism]]。$\\eta$ 是按 $a\\in O_H$ 索引的箭头族；$1_{M(p_Ha)}$ 是基范畴恒等箭头。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-202","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-eq-fibration-morphism|df-equality-fibration-morphism — Eq 纤维化态射]]"}],"outgoing":["478c99d853e13c93","fc49efccd7348d66","427be4d627513590","dacf0503b95c88a9","8b663a0efd45aead"]}